521	/** The account-level MySQL user the in-portal DB manager authenticates as. One
522	 *  per account, derived from the (already shell/SQL-safe) username. Kept <=32
523	 *  chars — MySQL's user-name limit. Usernames are `[a-z][a-z0-9]{2,31}` (no
524	 *  underscore), so `<username>_mgr` is unambiguous and never collides with a
525	 *  per-database user (`<username>_<slug>`) whose slug can't be the reserved
526	 *  literal `mgr` used here… — we simply reserve this name for the manager. */
