542	/**
543	 * The grant that scopes the DB-manager user to EXACTLY this account's own
544	 * databases and nothing else. The privilege target is `<username>\_%`.* — the
545	 * account username, a LITERAL underscore (escaped so it is not a LIKE wildcard),
