1636	 * Create a FREE, INDEPENDENT Nxeon-subdomain website — `<label>.<HOSTING_SUBDOMAIN_BASE>`
1637	 * (e.g. `myshop.sites.nxeon.cloud`) at the BASE zone, with its OWN docroot + vhost.
