1647	 * so there is nothing for the customer to point. It counts against maxSites like any
1648	 * other extra site, and is de-duplicated cross-tenant by the same atomic
1649	 * UNIQUE(hostname) claim every hostname path uses. Legacy nested subdomains created
1650	 * via createSubdomain keep working untouched (back-compat).
