136	  // `<username>.nxeon.cloud` subdomain, I'll connect a real domain later" — the
137	  // customer is never forced to own a domain to sign up. A REAL domain keeps every
138	  // cross-tenant guard it always had; the temp subdomain is derived from the
139	  // account's own per-node-unique username (below) so it can't collide with
140	  // anything a customer typed, and its uniqueness is still enforced by the SAME
141	  // atomic UNIQUE(hostname) claim inside the charge tx.
